+- Moving a task (`/move`) is a manager-only operation on the source project, like delete. The actor must also be a contributor or manager of the target project (viewers and org admins without a role there → 403; target missing or not readable → 404; target archived → 409). The task keeps its ID, title, status and assignee. The assignee must be a contributor or manager of the target project, otherwise → 400. A contributor in the target may only move tasks assigned to themselves (→ 403). Moving to the task's current project → 400.
